===============================================================================
EXCLUDED UPSTREAM SURFACES
===============================================================================

The following ReadMenator surfaces are intentionally NOT ported and MUST NOT be
copied into this repository:

  - Interactive HTML/JavaScript/CSS viewers and graph pages
  - 3D, force-graph, edge-bundling, flow, UML and component diagram pages
  - Video generation
  - GraphRAG index and search
  - GitHub wiki generation and wiki linting
  - Sphinx/Doxygen-style API documentation
  - MCP server
  - Agents, skills and rules installers
  - README injection and folder READMEs
  - Refactoring, dead-code and class-stub generators
  - Ollama integration
  - Vendored third-party code

Only the static analysis core (scanner, JS/TS parser, import resolver, graph,
metrics, layers and Markdown/Mermaid rendering) is eligible for porting.

